Package: otherworldspalettes
Title: Art-Inspired Palettes for Scientific Graphics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ola", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ola@example.com")
Description: Provides high-contrast qualitative colour palettes derived from
    the 'Other Worlds' art project. The palettes are ordered to reduce visual
    similarity between neighbouring colours and include optional discrete
    colour and fill scales for 'ggplot2'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/aolow/otherworldspalettes
BugReports: https://github.com/aolow/otherworldspalettes/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Suggests:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0)
